# Hotkeys — Rolltop's Shortcuts pane: keyboard shortcuts (快捷键), not Apple's Shortcuts app (快捷指令).
"Action" = "操作"
"Add" = "添加"
"Add ⌘, ⌥ or ⌃" = "加上 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃"
"Also used by “%@”, which takes precedence." = "“%@”也使用此快捷键，且优先生效。"
"Choose an item" = "选择一项"
"Clear" = "清除"
# Title of an item shortcut: "Click Wi-Fi".
"Click %@" = "点按“%@”"
"Click, then type a shortcut. Escape cancels, Delete clears." = "点按后输入快捷键。按 Escape 键取消，按 Delete 键清除。"
"Commands" = "命令"
"Filter shortcuts" = "过滤快捷键"
"Item" = "项"
"Menu bar items" = "菜单栏项"
"No matching commands" = "没有匹配的命令"
"Record shortcut" = "录制快捷键"
"Remove this shortcut" = "移除此快捷键"
"Right-click %@" = "右键点按“%@”"
"Shortcut" = "快捷键"
"Shortcuts" = "快捷键"
"Shortcuts work in every app. One that macOS also uses is marked and stays off; Rolltop cannot see shortcuts other apps use." = "快捷键在所有 App 中都有效。与 macOS 冲突的快捷键会被标出并保持停用；Rolltop 无法得知其他 App 使用的快捷键。"
"Show and click" = "显示并点按"
"Show and right-click" = "显示并右键点按"
"Shows the item for a moment if it is hidden, then clicks it. Needs Device Control and Data Access." = "如果该项已隐藏，会先短暂显示它，然后点按它。需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限。"
"Type shortcut" = "输入快捷键"
"Used by “%@”" = "已被“%@”使用"
"keyboard, hotkeys, keys, global shortcuts, item shortcuts" = "快捷键, 键盘, 热键, 按键, 全局快捷键, 项快捷键"
"macOS refused this shortcut (error %d); another app may use it." = "macOS 拒绝了此快捷键（错误 %d），它可能已被其他 App 使用。"
"macOS uses this shortcut. Change it here or turn it off in System Settings › Keyboard › Keyboard Shortcuts." = "macOS 已使用此快捷键。可以在此处更改，或在“系统设置 › 键盘 › 键盘快捷键”中关闭它。"
# Command groups in the Shortcuts pane.
"General" = "通用"
"Other" = "其他"
